ps von Fintech- und Logistikkunden.</p><ul class="cv-bullets"><li data-cv-path="/work/1/highlights/0">React-Native-Fahrer-App für einen Logistikkunden entwickelt, täglich von 3.500 Fahrer:innen genutzt.</li><li data-cv-path="/work/1/highlights/1">GraphQL-basiertes Portfolio-Dashboard für eine türkische Neobank in vier Monaten ausgeliefert.</li></ul></article></section><section class="cv-section" data-cv-section="skills" data-cv-path="/skills"><div class="cv-keep"><h2 class="cv-heading">Kenntnisse</h2><div class="cv-lines"><p data-cv-path="/skills/0"><span class="cv-line-label" data-cv-path="/skills/0/name">Frontend:</span> <span data-cv-path="/skills/0/keywords">React, TypeScript, Next.js, Redux, Tailwind CSS, Vite</span></p><p data-cv-path="/skills/1"><span class="cv-line-label" data-cv-path="/skills/1/name">Qualität:</span> <span data-cv-path="/skills/1/keywords">Barrierefreiheit (WCAG 2.2), Web-Performance, Jest, Playwright, Storybook</span></p><p data-cv-path="/skills/2"><span class="cv-line-label" data-cv-path="/skills/2/name">Produkt:</span> <span data-cv-path="/skills/2/keywords">Designsysteme, Figma, A/B-Tests, Lokalisierung</span></p></div></div></section><section class="cv-section" data-cv-section="education" data-cv-path="/education"><div class="cv-keep"><h2 class="cv-heading">Ausbildung</h2><article class="cv-entry is-short" data-cv-path="/education/0"><div class="cv-entry-head"><h3 class="cv-entry-title"><span class="cv-entry-role" data-cv-path="/education/0">B.Sc., Technische Informatik</span><span class="cv-entry-org"> · </span><span class="cv-entry-org" data-cv-path="/education/0/institution">Istanbul Technical University</span></h3><span class="cv-dates">Sept. 2015 – Juni 2019</span></div></article></div></section><section class="cv-section" data-cv-section="languages" data-cv-path="/languages"><div class="cv-keep"><h2 class="cv-heading">Sprachen</h2><div class="cv-lines"><p data-cv-path="/languages/0"><span class="cv-line-label" data-cv-path="/lang